% c255 (MOLA PDF 5: logical, audible cues in long rests): the tuba (since c251) and the bass clarinet enter ff at 27 after 20 bars of rest (7-26); part-only cello cue at 25-26, as the trombones have at 33-34
pOneTuba = { R1*14 | \tag #'score { R1*2 } \tag #'part { \cueDuring "vc" #UP { R1*2^\markup \tiny "Vc." } } | }
